  <item>
    <title>问题种子16 如何突破认知卡点？试试人生碰碰车</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fd314b1519139e4fec4e76</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fd314b1519139e4fec4e76</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Mar 2024 07:20:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小店今天迎来一位准备i的ENFP，一位刚从英国回来落地福州的橙友香花，马不停蹄的约上了这期的播客。我们无主题开始，聊了留学、星座、认识自我、做播客等等不好归类的话题，借用香花的话：“不已探索自己为出发，但最后回来发现，哦，那就是自己。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>🗺️收听地图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a> 如果担心自己在外留学太自闭，这题怎么解？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">15:54</a> 印象最深的国内外学校的差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">26:01</a> 半年后刚回到福州是什么感受？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1692">28:12</a> 与陌生人无语言交流中的善意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2333">38:53</a> 你需要多少的独处，多少的与人相处？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3064">51:04</a> 旅行中看见的不同，源自自己的状态变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3513">58:33</a> 在游戏中看见每个人心中的优先级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3763">1:02:43</a> 去新西兰“终老”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4023">1:07:03</a> 用“碰碰车”打破认知卡点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4377">1:12:57</a> 你本来就是摩羯，还是你活成了摩羯？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4514">1:15:14</a> 我们各自的天赋点（毫不费力）点在了哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6150">1:42:30</a> 香花的播客《喂喂喂》的起源</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>触碰 - Emotional Piano Background</span></p><span></span><p><span>✂️剪辑制作</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱吃冰激凌的老黄</span></p><span></span><p><span>📍录制场地</span></p><span></span><p><span>0号妙屋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhoOOXNXKMyQzuHViWc-RApMTqsJ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>如果你也有一颗问题种子，期待你也来问题小店与我们深度探讨。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎联系「问题收集员」橙柠七（微信号）：q-20200912</span></p>]]></description>
